# Large Model Checkpoints (>100MB GitHub limit)
# The web-ready ONNX model (public/models/wrist_model.onnx, 42.6MB) is tracked.
# The raw PyTorch checkpoint (models/wrist_model.pt, ~128MB) exceeds GitHub single-file limits.
*.pt
models/*.pt

